<rml>
<head>
  <title>Fotbiler Match Details</title>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss" />
  <link type="text/rcss" href="career_shell.rcss" />
  <link type="text/rcss" href="career_detail.rcss" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="career-screen">
    <div class="career-bg-deep"></div><div class="career-bg-blue"></div><div class="career-bg-accent"></div>
    <div class="career-shell">
      <div class="career-topbar"><div class="club-identity"><div class="club-crest">F</div><div class="club-copy"><div id="career-club-name" class="club-name">FOTBILER FC</div><div id="career-club-meta" class="club-meta">MANAGER CAREER · SEASON 2026/27</div></div></div><div class="career-status"><div class="status-block"><div class="status-label">MATCHDAY</div><div class="status-value">3</div></div><div class="status-block date-block"><div class="status-label">KICK OFF</div><div class="status-value">19:00</div></div></div></div>
      <div class="career-tabs"><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="career-central">CENTRAL</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="squad">SQUAD</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="transfers">TRANSFERS</div><div class="career-tab" tabindex="0" data-route="office">OFFICE</div><div class="career-tab active" tabindex="0" data-route="season">SEASON</div></div>
      <div class="career-detail-nav"><div class="career-detail-nav-item" tabindex="0" data-route="season">OVERVIEW</div><div class="career-detail-nav-item" tabindex="0" data-route="calendar-details">CALENDAR</div><div class="career-detail-nav-item" tabindex="0" data-route="competition-details">COMPETITION</div><div class="career-detail-nav-item active" tabindex="0" data-route="match-details">MATCH DETAILS</div></div>

      <div class="career-detail-content">
        <div class="career-detail-main"><div class="ui-card career-detail-card top" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">FOTBILER PREMIER LEAGUE · MATCHDAY 3</div><div class="career-detail-title">FOTBILER FC VS ANKARA UNITED</div><div class="career-detail-subtitle">Home · Fotbiler Stadium · Saturday · 19:00</div><div class="detail-stat-grid"><div class="detail-stat accent"><span>HOME FORM</span><strong>W D</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>LEAGUE POS</span><strong>3RD</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>OPPONENT POS</span><strong>2ND</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>FITNESS</span><strong>92%</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>MORALE</span><strong>GOOD</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>WEATHER</span><strong>CLEAR</strong></div></div></div><div class="ui-card career-detail-card bottom muted" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">MATCH PLAN</div><div class="career-detail-title">BALANCED · 4-2-3-1</div><div class="detail-stat-grid"><div class="detail-stat"><span>TACTIC</span><strong id="tactics-plan">BALANCED</strong></div><div class="detail-stat"><span>CHEMISTRY</span><strong id="tactics-chemistry">74</strong></div><div class="detail-stat accent"><span>STATUS</span><strong>READY</strong></div></div></div></div>
        <div class="career-detail-side"><div class="ui-card career-detail-card top dark" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">MATCHDAY ACTION</div><div class="career-detail-title light">READY TO PLAY</div><div class="detail-copy">Review the squad and tactics, then enter the 3D match engine. The final score is written back to the career save automatically.</div><span class="detail-action primary" tabindex="0" data-action="start-career-match">PLAY MATCH</span><span class="detail-action">SIMULATE</span></div><div class="ui-card career-detail-card bottom" tabindex="0"><div class="card-kicker">PRE-MATCH</div><div class="career-detail-title">QUICK LINKS</div><span class="detail-action primary" data-route="squad">TEAM SHEET</span><span class="detail-action" data-route="tactics">TACTICS</span><span class="detail-action" data-route="calendar-details">CALENDAR</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="career-control-strip"><div class="control-left"><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ENTER</span>Select</span><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ARROWS</span>Navigate</span><span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ESC</span>Back</span></div><div class="control-right">SEASON · MATCH DETAILS</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
